  "intro": {
    "title": "Audi",
    "subtitle": "Letting the rings do the talking.",
    "copy": "Some brands are recognisable without saying their name. Audi is one of them. Built around the idea of Vorsprung — staying a step ahead — the campaign explored the relationship between typography and one of the world's most iconic automotive symbols. The circular forms of the Vanguard typeface allowed the four rings to emerge naturally from the words themselves. Even alongside model names like A5 and Q5, the symbol did all the talking."
  },
