    {
      "image": {
        "src": "/media/media/Audi_symbol_1920.webm",
        "alt": "Audi Vorsprung 05"
      },
      "_template": "oneImage"
    },
    {
      "leftText": "Manifesto",
      "rightText": "It is not a word. \nIt is a mindset.\nThe instinct to stay a few steps ahead.\nNot a destination you reach, but a direction you keep choosing.\nMoving without knowing what you are capable of. And discovering the magic that happens after.\nTo lead is to face whatever comes next. \nNo excuses. No looking down on others. Only beyond the horizon.\nProgress. Setting the pace. Failing forward. \nFollowing the light. Jumping into the unknown. Being bolder than bold.\nVorsprung has its own language. \nIts own place. Its own borders. Its own rules. Its own beauty.\nBeyond the expected, there is a place.\n\nWe will meet you there.\n\nAudi Vorsprung",
      "_template": "twoText"
    },
